index c43b56a..dee58aa 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -362,6 +362,18 @@ file comments for the full list of tunable keys.
 
 ## Setup
 
+For a local OpenAI-compatible endpoint such as LM Studio, use the
+`openai` provider with a non-secret placeholder API key, the local
+base URL, and any reasoning control supported by that endpoint:
+
+```ini
+LLMChatter.Provider = openai
+LLMChatter.Model = qwen/qwen3.5-9b
+LLMChatter.OpenAI.ApiKey = lm-studio
+LLMChatter.OpenAI.BaseUrl = http://192.168.1.10:1234/v1
+LLMChatter.OpenAI.ReasoningEffort = none
+```
+
 ### Important: Disable Default Bot Chat
 
 This module **replaces** built-in playerbot chat. Add to `playerbots.conf`:
